<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>My Life System — Nairobi Edition</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --cream: #fdf6ec;
    --warm: #f5e6d0;
    --terracotta: #c4622d;
    --rust: #a0411a;
    --sage: #6b8f71;
    --deep-green: #2d5a35;
    --gold: #c9912a;
    --dark: #1e1a15;
    --mid: #5c4a32;
    --light-text: #8a7560;
    --red-flag: #c0392b;
    --urgent: #e8a020;
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    background: var(--cream);
    color: var(--dark);
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* HERO */
  .hero {
    background: var(--deep-green);
    color: var(--cream);
    padding: 60px 40px 50px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -80px; right: -80px;
    width: 320px; height: 320px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(201,145,42,0.15);
  }
  .hero::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -60px; left: 30%;
    width: 200px; height: 200px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(107,143,113,0.2);
  }
  .hero-inner { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .hero-tag {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .hero p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: rgba(253,246,236,0.75);
    max-width: 560px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .hero-chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
  .chip {
    background: rgba(253,246,236,0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(253,246,236,0.2);
    color: var(--cream);
    padding: 5px 14px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* URGENT BANNER */
  .urgent-banner {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c4622d, #a0411a);
    color: white;
    padding: 20px 40px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .urgent-banner .label {
    background: white;
    color: var(--rust);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .urgent-banner p { font-size: 14px; flex: 1; min-width: 200px; }
  .countdown { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* MAIN LAYOUT */
  main { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 24px 80px; }

  /* SECTION */
  section { margin-bottom: 52px; }
  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .section-icon {
    width: 44px; height: 44px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: grid; place-items: center;
    font-size: 20px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .icon-green { background: #d6ead8; }
  .icon-terracotta { background: #f5ddd2; }
  .icon-gold { background: #f5e9d0; }
  .icon-blue { background: #d0dff5; }
  .icon-purple { background: #e5d0f5; }

  .section-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }
  .section-subtitle { font-size: 13px; color: var(--light-text); margin-top: 2px; }

  /* CARDS */
  .card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
  }
  .card-title {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: var(--mid);
  }
  .card p, .card li { font-size: 14.5px; color: #3a3028; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .card ul { padding-left: 20px; }
  .card li { margin-bottom: 4px; }

  /* RIGHT NOW CARD */
  .now-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d6ead8, #eaf4eb);
    border: 2px solid var(--sage);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .now-card .now-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--deep-green);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .now-card p { font-size: 14.5px; margin-bottom: 6px; }

  /* GRID */
  .grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  @media(max-width: 620px) { .grid-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  /* SCHEDULE TABLE */
  .schedule-block {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
  }
  .schedule-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f0ebe3;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .schedule-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .schedule-time {
    padding: 14px 16px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: white;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .schedule-content {
    padding: 14px 20px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
  }
  .schedule-content strong { display: block; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .schedule-content span { font-size: 12px; color: var(--light-text); }
  .t-sleep { background: #2d5a35; }
  .t-morning { background: #c9912a; }
  .t-commute { background: #5c7a8a; }
  .t-work { background: #4a5a6a; }
  .t-evening { background: #c4622d; }
  .t-night { background: #5a4072; }
  .t-micro { background: var(--sage); }
  .highlight-row .schedule-content { background: #fffbf0; border-left-color: var(--gold); }
  .tip-row .schedule-content { background: #f0f7f1; border-left-color: var(--sage); }

  /* PILL TAGS */
  .pill { display: inline-block; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; margin: 2px; }
  .pill-red { background: #fde8e8; color: #c0392b; }
  .pill-green { background: #e0f0e3; color: #2d5a35; }
  .pill-orange { background: #fef0e0; color: #c4622d; }
  .pill-blue { background: #e0ecf8; color: #2c5282; }
  .pill-purple { background: #ede0f8; color: #553c7b; }

  /* DEADLINE TRACKER */
  .deadline-item {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--terracotta);
    border: 1px solid #f0ebe3;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--terracotta);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
  }
  .deadline-item.moderate { border-left-color: var(--gold); }
  .deadline-item.safe { border-left-color: var(--sage); }
  .deadline-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .deadline-name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 14.5px; }
  .deadline-date { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 8px; }
  .urgent-date { background: #fde8e8; color: #c0392b; }
  .moderate-date { background: #fef0e0; color: #c4622d; }
  .safe-date { background: #e0f0e3; color: #2d5a35; }
  .deadline-plan { font-size: 13px; color: #5c4a32; }

  /* PROGRESS BAR */
  .progress-wrap { margin-top: 10px; }
  .progress-label { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 11px; color: var(--light-text); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .progress-bar { background: #f0ebe3; border-radius: 4px; height: 6px; overflow: hidden; }
  .progress-fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 4px; }
  .fill-red { background: #c0392b; }
  .fill-orange { background: #e8a020; }
  .fill-green { background: var(--sage); }

  /* FOOD SECTION */
  .food-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; }
  @media(max-width: 680px) { .food-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  @media(max-width: 420px) { .food-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .food-card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 18px;
    border: 1px solid #f0ebe3;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
  }
  .food-card .emoji { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .food-card h4 { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px; color: var(--mid); }
  .food-card p { font-size: 12.5px; color: #5c4a32; }

  /* EXERCISE BLOCKS */
  .exercise-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    border: 1px solid #f0ebe3;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .exercise-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }
  .exercise-info h4 { font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .exercise-info p { font-size: 13px; color: #5c4a32; }

  /* HEALTH NOTICE */
  .health-notice {
    background: #fff8e8;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--gold);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .health-notice h4 { font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: var(--rust); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .health-notice p { font-size: 13.5px; color: #5c4a32; }

  /* MINDSET SECTION */
  .quote-block {
    background: var(--deep-green);
    color: var(--cream);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 30px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .quote-block blockquote {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .quote-block cite { font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.6; font-style: normal; }

  /* WEEKEND PLAN */
  .weekend-col {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 20px;
    border: 1px solid #f0ebe3;
  }
  .weekend-col h3 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .weekend-col ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  .weekend-col li { font-size: 13.5px; padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f5f0ea; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; }
  .weekend-col li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .weekend-col li::before { content: '→'; color: var(--terracotta); font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* SYSTEMS TIPS */
  .system-tip {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    border: 1px solid #f0ebe3;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
  }
  .system-tip .num {
    width: 32px; height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--deep-green);
    color: white;
    display: grid; place-items: center;
    font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .system-tip h4 { font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .system-tip p { font-size: 13px; color: #5c4a32; }

  /* COUNTDOWN CLOCK */
  .countdown-clock {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  .clock-unit {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    min-width: 40px;
  }
  .clock-unit span {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .clock-unit small {
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.7;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .clock-sep {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  /* CHECKOUT LOG */
  .checkout-section {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1px solid #e8e0d5;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  }
  .checkout-header {
    background: var(--deep-green);
    color: var(--cream);
    padding: 24px 28px;
  }
  .checkout-header h3 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .checkout-header p { font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.8; }

  .checkout-week-tabs {
    display: flex;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f0ebe3;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .week-tab {
    padding: 12px 20px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer;
    white-space: nowrap;
    border-bottom: 3px solid transparent;
    color: var(--light-text);
    background: none;
    border-left: none;
    border-right: none;
    border-top: none;
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .week-tab.active {
    color: var(--deep-green);
    border-bottom-color: var(--deep-green);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .week-tab:hover { color: var(--mid); background: #faf7f3; }

  .checkout-body { padding: 24px 28px; }

  .checkout-date-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--light-text);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .checkout-input-area {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 100px;
    border: 1.5px solid #e8e0d5;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--dark);
    background: #fdf9f4;
    resize: vertical;
    line-height: 1.6;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .checkout-input-area:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--sage);
    background: white;
  }
  .checkout-input-area::placeholder { color: #b8a898; font-style: italic; }

  .checkout-prompts {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 14px 0;
  }
  .prompt-chip {
    background: #f0f7f1;
    color: var(--deep-green);
    border: 1px solid #c2ddc5;
    padding: 5px 12px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s;
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  }
  .prompt-chip:hover { background: var(--deep-green); color: white; }

  .checkout-save-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 16px;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .save-btn {
    background: var(--deep-green);
    color: white;
    border: none;
    padding: 10px 24px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .save-btn:hover { background: var(--rust); }
  .save-hint { font-size: 12px; color: var(--light-text); font-style: italic; }

  .saved-entries { margin-top: 24px; }
  .saved-entry {
    background: #f7fbf7;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--sage);
    border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .saved-entry-meta {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--sage);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .saved-entry-text { font-size: 14px; color: var(--dark); white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.6; }
  .delete-entry {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10px; right: 12px;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: #ccc;
    font-size: 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
    line-height: 1;
    transition: color 0.15s;
    font-family: sans-serif;
  }
  .delete-entry:hover { color: var(--red-flag); }

  .empty-state {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 30px;
    color: var(--light-text);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .empty-state .big { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }

  /* FOOTER */
  footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 30px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--light-text);
    border-top: 1px solid #e8e0d5;
  }

  /* SCROLLBAR */
  ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--cream); }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--sage); border-radius: 3px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- HERO -->
<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-tag">🌿 Your Personal Life System · Nairobi, March 2026</div>
    <h1>A System That Works <em>With</em> You,<br>Not Against You</h1>
    <p>Weight loss, wellness, study deadlines, and a life you actually enjoy — built around your real schedule, not an imaginary one.</p>
    <div class="hero-chips">
      <span class="chip">🍏 Nutrition</span>
      <span class="chip">💪 Exercise</span>
      <span class="chip">📅 Schedule</span>
      <span class="chip">🖥️ Study Deadlines</span>
      <span class="chip">🏊 Swimming</span>
      <span class="chip">🎓 Scholarship</span>
      <span class="chip">🌧️ Rain-Proof</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- URGENT BANNER -->
<div class="urgent-banner">
  <span class="label">⚠️ URGENT</span>
  <p><strong>Python I, Python II, JavaScript 2</strong> deadlines are <strong>March 20, 2026 — 11:59 PM EAT</strong>. CCNA continues till April.</p>
  <div class="countdown-clock" id="countdown-clock">
    <div class="clock-unit"><span id="cd-days">--</span><small>days</small></div>
    <div class="clock-sep">:</div>
    <div class="clock-unit"><span id="cd-hours">--</span><small>hrs</small></div>
    <div class="clock-sep">:</div>
    <div class="clock-unit"><span id="cd-mins">--</span><small>min</small></div>
    <div class="clock-sep">:</div>
    <div class="clock-unit"><span id="cd-secs">--</span><small>sec</small></div>
  </div>
</div>

<main>

  <!-- RIGHT NOW -->
  <section>
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-icon icon-green">🌿</div>
      <div>
        <div class="section-title">Right Now — What to Eat at 10 AM</div>
        <div class="section-subtitle">You're hungry, yesterday's feast is still processing, you had apples for supper</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="now-card">
      <div class="now-title">✅ What to eat right now</div>
      <p><strong>Your digestive system is still working hard</strong> — don't pile on more heavy food. You need something light, satisfying, and that helps things move.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:10px;"><strong>Best options for this morning:</strong></p>
      <ul style="padding-left:20px; margin-top:6px;">
        <li>🥚 <strong>2 boiled or scrambled eggs</strong> — protein that won't overload digestion</li>
        <li>🍌 <strong>A banana or papaya</strong> — papaya especially helps digestion (contains papain enzyme)</li>
        <li>☕ <strong>Warm water with lemon or ginger tea</strong> — helps the digestive process</li>
        <li>🍏 <strong>Your apple!</strong> — keep it whole, not juice. Whole apples have fiber that slows sugar absorption</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top:12px; color:#2d5a35;"><strong>❌ Avoid right now:</strong> Heavy carbs (bread, ugali), dairy (yogurt/ice cream can slow digestion when you're backed up), large portions.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="health-notice">
      <h4>💧 Hydration Note</h4>
      <p>Drink 2–3 glasses of water <em>before</em> your first meal. This helps with the "haven't popped much" situation and is also one of the simplest weight management tools. Warm water is best first thing in the morning.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- NUTRITION -->
  <section>
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-icon icon-terracotta">🥗</div>
      <div>
        <div class="section-title">Nutrition System</div>
        <div class="section-subtitle">Built around your apple love, your busy schedule, and your weight goals</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">The Core Principle — Crowd Out, Don't Cut Out</div>
      <p>You won't stick to strict elimination diets. Instead, <strong>add good things until there's less room for the rest.</strong> This means more protein, more vegetables, more water — so the carbs and sweets naturally reduce.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="food-grid">
      <div class="food-card">
        <div class="emoji">🍏</div>
        <h4>Apples — Keep Them!</h4>
        <p>Always eat whole apples, never juice. The fiber in the skin slows sugar release. Max 2 per day. Add peanut butter for protein + satiety.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="food-card">
